{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02763","headline":"咏史四首 四 · 卢照邻","name":"咏史四首 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔有平陵男，姓朱名阿游。\n直发上冲冠，壮气横三秋。\n愿得斩马劒，先断佞臣头。\n天子玉槛折，将军丹血流。\n捐生不肯拜，视死其若休。\n归来教乡里，童蒙远相求。\n弟子数百人，散在十二州。\n三公不敢吏，五鹿何能酬。\n名与日月悬，义与天壤俦。\n何必疲执戟，区区在封侯。\n伟哉旷达士，知命固不忧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢照邻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02763.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02763","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}